  "version": 1,
  "title": "Self-similar counterexamples to three conjectures of Lorentz",
  "abstract": "Three continuous counterexamples in uniform polynomial approximation: a nonodd function whose best approximants all vanish at zero, a nonodd function with plateaus at degrees (2k+1,2k+2), and a noneven function with plateaus at degrees (2k,2k+1). Exact algebraic certificates, analytic contact persistence, and cubic self-similarity prove all three results. This repository contains the substantive formalization and formalizes the owner-supplied mathematical manuscripts.",
